<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Your Application for {!relatedTo.Position__r.Name} Has Been Received!" recipientType="Contact" relatedToType="Axolt__Job_Applicant__c">
    <messaging:plainTextEmailBody >
        Dear {!Recipient.Name},

        Thank you for applying for the position of {!relatedTo.Position__r.Name} at Axolt pvt ltd. We have received your application and appreciate your interest in joining our team.

        Our recruitment team is currently reviewing your application. If your qualifications align with our needs, we will contact you to discuss the next steps.

        In the meantime, if you have any questions, please feel free to reach out to us at aq@gmail.com.

        Thank you once again for your interest in Axolt. We wish you the best of luck in your job search.

        Best regards,
        Axolt
        HR Manager
       
       
    </messaging:plainTextEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>